  - m_Id: 223623249920
    m_Localized: No active symptoms
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 223635832832
    m_Localized: The ambulance arrived on time thanks to your help. {patientName}
      didn't even develop any complications!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 223635832833
    m_Localized: 'The ambulance arrived on time thanks to your help. However, {patientName}
      developed: {complications}.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 223635832834
    m_Localized: Great job! The condition has been stabilized. {patientName} has
      no complications.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 223635832835
    m_Localized: 'The condition has been stabilized. However, {patientName} developed
      the following complications: {complications}.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 223635832836
    m_Localized: Unfortunately, the patient passed away. {patientName} died from
      {deathCause}.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
